# Adds this library's auto-configuration to every @WebMvcTest slice (spring-boot-webmvc-test 4.1).
#
# A slice runs only the auto-configurations listed under its own annotations, read from every jar's
# META-INF/spring/<annotation>.imports. A consumer whose slice includes a Filter or @Component that
# draws on RotatingSecrets would otherwise fail to start every slice. Under test no config tree is
# imported, so the reloader it brings does nothing. Read only by the slice: nothing outside a test
# loads this file.
dev.bluestep.secretfiles.spring.SecretFilesAutoConfiguration
